    "/api/tasks": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "Submit Task",
        "description": "提交新任务 — 创建 Task 记录并分配 PM Agent。\n\n新流程 (PM Agent 架构):\n1. 创建 Task 记录 (status=pending, pm_agent_id=\"\")\n2. 选择合适 work_station (按评级/在线状态)\n3. POST 到目标 Worker /role/start-pm (携带 task_id, secretary_url)\n4. 更新 Task.pm_agent_id, status=running\n5. WebSocket 广播 task_submitted + pm_registered",
        "operationId": "submit_task_api_tasks_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
